      "frame": "Each frame shows the whole wall (->wall width height units) and nothing outside it. The wall's centre is (0, 0), +x is right and +y is up, so a wall 16 wide and 9 tall runs from x -8 to 8 and y -4.5 to 4.5. Time runs from 0 to the scene's ->duration in seconds, and the window loops it. Colours are sRGB as typed: 0x808080 shows as mid grey."
